OL,3,GNEWSADUP minister 'confident' of
OL,4,Arevised Stormont funding offer
OL,5,
OL,6,FStormont's Education Minister Paul
OL,7,FGivan has said he is "confident" of a
OL,8,Frevised financial offer from the
OL,9,Fgovernment on Friday, but still does
OL,10,Fnot believe it will go far enough to
OL,11,Fresolve the budget deadlock.
OL,13,FOn Monday, Northern Ireland Secretary
OL,14,FSir Chris Bryant visited Stormont and
OL,15,Fmade an initial offer of #350m per year
OL,16,Fover the next three years to help
OL,17,Fstabilise the executive's finances.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
