OL,3,GNEWSADUP minister 'confident' of
OL,4,Arevised Stormont funding offer
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut executive parties rejected that and
OL,7,Fsaid the government would need to
OL,8,Fincrease its contribution in order for
OL,9,FStormont to balance its books this
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FIt is understood the discussions on
OL,13,FFriday morning will take place
OL,14,Fvirtually.
